sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor ACC as Kế toán
  participant BIL as billing
  participant CON as contract
  participant PRI as pricing
  participant WF as workflow
  participant ES as mock-esign
  participant K as Kafka
  ACC->>BIL: POST /payments/generate
  BIL->>CON: GET /contracts/{id} (kiểm hiệu lực - PAY-01)
  BIL->>PRI: GET /pricing/effective (copy đơn giá - PAY-03)
  ACC->>BIL: submit → workflow (PAYMENT)
  ACC->>WF: duyệt các cấp
  WF->>WF: cấp cuối approve → tự khởi động ký
  WF->>ES: POST /sign (bất đồng bộ)
  ES-->>WF: callback signed
  WF-->>K: esign.events: Signed
  K-->>BIL: Signed → Payment = Issued
